// Temporary hit points modeled with the existing Shielded buff
// (common/src/comp/buff.rs: "Temp-HP / absorb shield... Grants an absorb
// pool equal to strength that soaks incoming damage before real HP") -- an
// exact fit for "grants temporary hit points, ends when they are depleted"
// (see `false_life.ron`, the same recipe at a lower circle). Strength scaled
// up from `false_life.ron`'s circle-1 20.0 for this spell's circle-3 tier;
// duration matches the spell's own `Concentration(60)` rather than
// `false_life.ron`'s 1-hour instant buff.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Shielded, data: BuffData(strength: 35.0, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 45,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
